  "definition": "Sea Urchins",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-07-01",
  "historyNote": "#5736, eff 11-23-93; ss by #5789, eff 2-18-94; amd by #6176, eff 1-27-96; ss by #6443, eff 5-15-97; ss by #8087, eff 5-27-04; ss by #10095, eff 2-29-12; ss by #13399, eff 7-1-22",
